1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Growl growl!

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Once upon a time, at the far reaches of space,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
the minor planet Kumaria exploded.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
The fragments of Kumaria that remained

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
became a meteor swarm that rained down upon Earth.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
That swarm made the world's bears rise up together as one.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Then, they all started attacking humans.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Like, who could have seen that coming, right?

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The humans then decided to build the Wall of Severance

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
in an attempt to drive all the bears, like us,

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
away from their world.

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,000
But guess what?

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Silly old man-made rules don't work on bears!

14
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Do the math, humans! Growl!

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
We are bears! We can't help that!

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Bears eat people!

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
That's kind of like our thing!

18
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
And so...

19
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
From the beginning, we hated you.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
But also, we loved you from the beginning as well.

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
All we wanted was to become true friends with you

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
So we had to cross the Wall

23
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Chop, chop!

24
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Munch-munch!

25
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Chow-chop!

26
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Much-munch!

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Chow-chop!

28
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Munch-munch!

29
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Chow-chop!

30
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Those bears!

31
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
They're eating a girl!!

32
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,000
ChYeahck...

33
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Those are the transfer students!

34
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Oh, I get it!

35
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,000
They've transformed!

36
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
They're only pretending to be human!

37
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
They're really bears!

38
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Cheers!

39
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Kirikuma!

40
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Kirikuma Hiroshi!

41
00:02:59,054 --> 00:03:11,094
Tragically, during an attack by two vicious bears, our friend Sumika Izumino lost her earthly life.

42
00:03:11,734 --> 00:03:15,574
Next to speak, on behalf of the student body, Mitsuko Yurizono.

43
00:03:16,494 --> 00:03:19,654
She has been kind enough to deliver the lovely Sumika's eulogy.

44
00:03:22,014 --> 00:03:24,694
Sumika Izumino was a gentle person.

45
00:03:24,694 --> 00:03:30,354
She regularly showed kindness to the weak and was always generous with her love.

46
00:03:31,714 --> 00:03:37,574
No matter what, Sumika never lost sight of herself, bearing the open heart her name's...

47
00:03:37,574 --> 00:03:39,554
Shouk!

48
00:03:42,994 --> 00:03:45,174
Mitsuko, dear. Are you alright?

49
00:03:45,834 --> 00:03:48,134
I'm fine. I'm sorry. I can do this.

50
00:03:48,794 --> 00:03:52,894
Izumino will be remembered like a white wildflower in the fields of spring.

51
00:03:52,894 --> 00:03:56,734
She was brave and sweet. She was graceful.

52
00:04:06,834 --> 00:04:08,074
It can't be.

53
00:04:09,214 --> 00:04:13,174
I refuse to believe my Sumika was eaten by those awful bears.

54
00:04:13,174 --> 00:04:17,614
That can't be true. It's a lie!

55
00:04:21,614 --> 00:04:25,374
Please forgive Kureha for not being able to come to the memorial today.

56
00:04:26,034 --> 00:04:27,634
She's having a difficult time.

57
00:04:33,274 --> 00:04:34,214
Poor thing.

58
00:04:34,214 --> 00:04:39,274
She's lost someone important to her again.

59
00:04:39,634 --> 00:04:41,774
I can't imagine how much she must be hurting.

60
00:04:41,774 --> 00:04:47,114
Kureha? Did you have fun with your friend again today?

61
00:04:47,994 --> 00:04:52,254
What's wrong? You seem down. Oh, please don't look so sad.

62
00:04:53,174 --> 00:04:55,714
Aw, you really love her, don't you, sweetie?

63
00:04:56,674 --> 00:04:59,734
It's okay. I'm sure you'll see her another time.

64
00:05:00,734 --> 00:05:04,254
All you have to do is just keep wishing really hard.

65
00:05:04,254 --> 00:05:22,174
No matter how hard I wish, I'll never see Sumika again.

66
00:05:23,474 --> 00:05:26,894
I failed her. Why couldn't I protect my friend?

67
00:05:26,894 --> 00:05:31,674
Bears are, like, the worst.

68
00:05:32,034 --> 00:05:34,014
Does the Wall of Severance even do anything?

69
00:05:34,254 --> 00:05:36,314
I mean, if a bear got through it...

70
00:05:36,314 --> 00:05:39,874
Oh, which reminds me, I heard another girl from that same class is missing.

71
00:05:40,294 --> 00:05:43,054
Are you serious? You think the bear got her, too?

72
00:05:43,294 --> 00:05:47,134
Yeah, probably, but I guess it can't be official until they actually find a body.

73
00:05:47,774 --> 00:05:48,974
Bears are disgusting.

74
00:05:49,234 --> 00:05:49,914
ROWL!

75
00:05:50,554 --> 00:05:53,374
Those girls are horrible, but they still look so tasty.

76
00:05:53,374 --> 00:05:58,714
You know what's weird? That one girl, Kureha, she's not here today.

77
00:05:59,194 --> 00:06:04,074
Yeah, you're right. We can't exactly target her if she refuses to show up at school.

78
00:06:04,774 --> 00:06:08,354
Kureha Tsubaki has such a delicious smell. Yummy girl.

79
00:06:09,074 --> 00:06:12,854
When you're being cool like this, you have a gorgeous smell, too.

80
00:06:14,014 --> 00:06:17,434
Like a wild animal. It makes Lulu giddy.

81
00:06:17,434 --> 00:06:22,674
Lulu just had the greatest idea ever!

82
00:06:23,214 --> 00:06:25,494
Yay, Lulu! So clever!

83
00:06:31,574 --> 00:06:33,134
There's no doubt about it.

84
00:06:34,054 --> 00:06:36,394
Ginko Yurishiro and Lulu Yurigasaki.

85
00:06:37,114 --> 00:06:39,274
Those transfer students are actually bears.

86
00:06:39,274 --> 00:06:44,874
This is terrible, but what I saw at the flower bed is proof I'm right.

87
00:06:44,874 --> 00:06:50,534
Mitsuko. Hey, Mitsuko. Earth to Mitsuko.

88
00:06:52,714 --> 00:06:53,714
Hi, Konomi.

89
00:06:54,374 --> 00:06:57,674
You're completely zoned out, Mitsuko. You've been acting weird.

90
00:06:58,314 --> 00:07:00,174
I'm starting to get super worried about you.

91
00:07:01,314 --> 00:07:02,554
Don't be. I'm fine.

92
00:07:03,114 --> 00:07:05,794
How can you be so concerned about some random girl?

93
00:07:05,794 --> 00:07:10,054
I know the truth. You're trying to get close to her.

94
00:07:10,774 --> 00:07:13,434
What's so great about Kureha Tsubaki, though?

95
00:07:13,434 --> 00:07:15,434
Why her?

96
00:07:16,154 --> 00:07:21,554
You've got to know if you make friends with that girl, the invisible storm will attack you, too.

97
00:07:22,274 --> 00:07:23,814
I don't want you to be hurt.

98
00:07:24,514 --> 00:07:28,354
Now that Sumika's dead, Kureha's obviously going to be next.

99
00:07:29,354 --> 00:07:30,094
Yes, I know.

100
00:07:30,774 --> 00:07:34,494
Kureha will be targeted because she refused to back down on her love for Sumika.

101
00:07:34,494 --> 00:07:39,314
Girls who don't follow the mood of the herd get excluded and ostracized.

102
00:07:39,794 --> 00:07:41,574
That's how the system works, isn't it?

103
00:07:42,394 --> 00:07:43,394
Then why bother?

104
00:07:43,914 --> 00:07:46,314
Because there's more than Kureha worrying me.

105
00:07:46,614 --> 00:07:50,034
What is it? You have to know by now you can tell me anything.

106
00:07:50,494 --> 00:07:51,634
If you say so.

107
00:07:52,314 --> 00:07:55,794
The truth is, I saw something awful the other day.

108
00:07:55,794 --> 00:07:59,954
Hey there, girl!

109
00:08:00,434 --> 00:08:02,954
We're the new transfer students and you can call this one Lulu!

110
00:08:03,614 --> 00:08:05,134
And my name is Ginko.

111
00:08:06,854 --> 00:08:09,914
Anyway, we were hoping you'd be a deer and let us stay with you.

112
00:08:10,494 --> 00:08:10,974
What?

113
00:08:11,514 --> 00:08:11,994
Growl!

114
00:08:12,394 --> 00:08:13,734
What a cute house!

115
00:08:15,234 --> 00:08:17,314
Hey, you're not using the attic, right?

116
00:08:17,554 --> 00:08:19,334
We'd be fine up there if that's okay.

117
00:08:19,334 --> 00:08:22,434
What are you talking about?

118
00:08:23,234 --> 00:08:27,334
Ever since Ginko and Lulu moved to this town, we've had to sleep outside.

119
00:08:27,514 --> 00:08:27,994
Growl!

120
00:08:28,394 --> 00:08:29,654
Lulu itches all over!

121
00:08:29,754 --> 00:08:32,514
What if it's too late and she already has the fleas?

122
00:08:33,334 --> 00:08:33,854
Please!

123
00:08:33,914 --> 00:08:35,254
Can't we at least use your bath?

124
00:08:35,614 --> 00:08:37,334
There's no harm in that, is there?

125
00:08:39,954 --> 00:08:41,754
Yeah, just a bath is okay.

126
00:08:41,994 --> 00:08:42,434
Yay!

127
00:08:43,054 --> 00:08:44,094
Negotiation successful!

128
00:08:44,334 --> 00:08:45,314
Lulu is clever!

129
00:08:46,194 --> 00:08:47,034
Hold on!

130
00:08:47,034 --> 00:08:48,634
It's just for today, got it?

131
00:08:48,634 --> 00:08:49,354
Hello?

132
00:08:50,014 --> 00:08:51,754
Did you hear me, whatever your name is?

133
00:08:51,854 --> 00:08:52,994
You can call Lulu Lulu!

134
00:08:53,494 --> 00:08:53,734
What?

135
00:08:54,834 --> 00:08:56,894
That's right, and you can call me Ginko.

136
00:09:02,114 --> 00:09:04,074
I could taste tears on your cheek.

137
00:09:04,494 --> 00:09:05,134
Growl, growl.

138
00:09:06,654 --> 00:09:07,634
You could what?

139
00:09:10,154 --> 00:09:14,154
Bathing, bathing, baths are super duper fun for Lulu.

140
00:09:14,154 --> 00:09:16,154
Bubble, bubbles everywhere.

141
00:09:16,574 --> 00:09:18,474
Growl, growl, growl!

142
00:09:18,634 --> 00:09:18,854
Growl!

143
00:09:20,854 --> 00:09:22,354
You can't stay here.

144
00:09:22,934 --> 00:09:25,534
I'm sorry, but after you finish that, you both need to go.

145
00:09:26,614 --> 00:09:28,854
Were you crying, growl, growl?

146
00:09:30,694 --> 00:09:32,234
Of course I wasn't crying.

147
00:09:34,854 --> 00:09:36,874
Growl, say what you will.

148
00:09:37,434 --> 00:09:40,754
But I bet you didn't know that sad and lonely tears taste kind of sweet.

149
00:09:40,754 --> 00:09:45,974
Growl, growl, growl.

150
00:09:45,974 --> 00:09:48,234
Growl, this is pure heaven.

151
00:09:49,974 --> 00:09:53,674
Lulu can't believe we safely invaded Kureha's house.

152
00:09:53,974 --> 00:09:55,194
Who's a clever girl?

153
00:09:56,054 --> 00:09:56,874
It's Lulu!

154
00:09:56,874 --> 00:09:57,474
Growl!

155
00:10:05,474 --> 00:10:09,694
Yeah, so anyway, once she's finished in there, I want both of you to get out.

156
00:10:09,914 --> 00:10:12,594
I guess you can still take a bath, though, if you really want one.

157
00:10:12,594 --> 00:10:14,954
I don't growl, growl, growl.

158
00:10:15,374 --> 00:10:15,854
Fine.

159
00:10:24,194 --> 00:10:25,474
What's with this girl?

160
00:10:25,974 --> 00:10:27,514
She won't stop staring at me.

161
00:10:27,934 --> 00:10:29,874
Then who in their right mind licks someone?

162
00:10:31,814 --> 00:10:32,334
Gross.

163
00:10:32,334 --> 00:10:36,114
And not to mention all that weird growl business.

164
00:10:36,514 --> 00:10:37,494
What is that about?

165
00:10:38,314 --> 00:10:40,554
Kureha, your love is the real thing.

166
00:10:42,974 --> 00:10:44,894
I could taste it in your tears.

167
00:10:45,194 --> 00:10:46,514
Your love is a true love.

168
00:10:46,754 --> 00:10:47,534
Growl, growl.

169
00:10:55,114 --> 00:10:57,474
I love you so much, Kureha.

170
00:10:59,194 --> 00:11:00,874
And I always will.

171
00:11:02,334 --> 00:11:05,914
What would you know about it?

172
00:11:06,654 --> 00:11:07,294
I know.

173
00:11:07,694 --> 00:11:09,514
Because my love is true, too.

174
00:11:11,614 --> 00:11:12,714
There's no way!

175
00:11:13,194 --> 00:11:15,714
You don't have a clue about Sumika or what she meant to me!

176
00:11:15,954 --> 00:11:17,174
So don't pretend like you do!

177
00:11:29,174 --> 00:11:29,574
Growl.

178
00:11:29,574 --> 00:11:31,174
You're a real man.

179
00:11:32,334 --> 00:11:36,574
Kureha Tsubaki, I've longed to see you.

180
00:11:37,294 --> 00:11:40,194
In fact, we came here precisely for that purpose.

181
00:11:40,774 --> 00:11:41,674
To see me?

182
00:11:42,034 --> 00:11:42,714
But why?

183
00:11:47,034 --> 00:11:48,334
Because of your smell.

184
00:11:48,654 --> 00:11:50,014
Such a delicious scent.

185
00:11:50,234 --> 00:11:50,654
Growl.

186
00:11:50,654 --> 00:11:52,974
Oh yes, I'll show you my love.

187
00:12:00,174 --> 00:12:01,554
Mitsuko, is something wrong?

188
00:12:04,874 --> 00:12:06,214
Wait, what are you doing?

189
00:12:06,754 --> 00:12:09,134
I want you to get away from Kureha now!

190
00:12:09,134 --> 00:12:11,774
Ginko, Ginko, Yurashiro, Lulu, Yurigasaki?

191
00:12:12,194 --> 00:12:15,514
I know what the two of you really are, so back off of her or else!

192
00:12:15,514 --> 00:12:30,974
That's right, I saw you!

193
00:12:30,974 --> 00:12:33,714
I witnessed exactly what you were doing that day!

194
00:12:33,714 --> 00:12:35,494
Now get out of here!

195
00:12:35,894 --> 00:12:39,474
I'm not going to let you lay a finger on Kureha, do you understand me?

196
00:12:40,034 --> 00:12:41,714
Show her what you really are!

197
00:12:41,714 --> 00:13:02,114
Damn it, they were too fast!

198
00:13:02,114 --> 00:13:03,874
What's going on?

199
00:13:04,834 --> 00:13:05,354
Mitsuko?

200
00:13:05,514 --> 00:13:07,174
I'm sorry, there's no time to talk!

201
00:13:07,554 --> 00:13:08,734
I've got to go after them!

202
00:13:13,314 --> 00:13:15,194
This day can't get any weirder.

203
00:13:27,314 --> 00:13:27,834
Hello?

204
00:13:27,834 --> 00:13:29,914
Is your love the real thing?

205
00:13:31,494 --> 00:13:35,394
This is a challenge from the Wall of Severance, Kureha, Tsubaki.

206
00:13:36,114 --> 00:13:40,394
If your love is true, go to the roof immediately.

207
00:13:41,754 --> 00:13:43,234
The bears are waiting for you.

208
00:13:43,554 --> 00:13:44,254
Who is this?

209
00:13:44,534 --> 00:13:45,594
What do you want from me?

210
00:13:46,394 --> 00:13:51,214
Give yourself over to the bears, and your love will be approved.

211
00:13:51,694 --> 00:13:52,854
What does that mean?

212
00:13:53,194 --> 00:13:53,954
Answer me!

213
00:13:57,834 --> 00:13:59,774
My love, approved?

214
00:14:12,994 --> 00:14:14,354
Mitsuko loves her?

215
00:14:14,734 --> 00:14:16,714
What's so great about that Kureha girl?

216
00:14:17,994 --> 00:14:20,294
I've never seen her like this before.

217
00:14:21,294 --> 00:14:23,734
I won't allow it, I won't!

218
00:14:24,394 --> 00:14:25,654
Mitsuko belongs to me!

219
00:14:25,654 --> 00:14:27,394
No one else can have her!

220
00:14:27,914 --> 00:14:28,794
She's mine!

221
00:14:32,314 --> 00:14:34,974
Kureha Tsubaki, you must be destroyed!

222
00:14:35,354 --> 00:14:35,874
Chug!

223
00:14:37,234 --> 00:14:39,874
I, Konami Yurikawa, will eat you!

224
00:14:40,414 --> 00:14:41,174
Kuchuk!

225
00:14:41,394 --> 00:14:41,894
Nasty!

226
00:14:42,654 --> 00:14:43,934
Nasty girl!

227
00:14:44,934 --> 00:14:45,374
Gah!

228
00:14:45,614 --> 00:14:46,334
Gah!

229
00:14:46,334 --> 00:14:46,414
Gah!

230
00:14:46,414 --> 00:14:46,494
Gah!

231
00:14:46,494 --> 00:14:46,894
Gah!

232
00:14:46,894 --> 00:14:47,094
Gah!

233
00:14:47,094 --> 00:14:47,214
Gah!

234
00:14:47,214 --> 00:14:47,574
Gah!

235
00:14:47,574 --> 00:14:47,614
Gah!

236
00:14:47,614 --> 00:14:47,694
Gah!

237
00:14:47,694 --> 00:14:48,094
Gah!

238
00:14:48,094 --> 00:14:48,134
Gah!

239
00:14:48,134 --> 00:14:48,254
Gah!

240
00:14:48,254 --> 00:14:48,614
Gah!

241
00:14:48,614 --> 00:14:49,094
Gah!

242
00:14:49,094 --> 00:14:52,374
The time for judgment has come, growl, growl.

243
00:14:52,374 --> 00:15:00,054
I'll never forgive those bears!

244
00:15:00,494 --> 00:15:01,354
I'll ruin them!

245
00:15:01,714 --> 00:15:02,414
Every one!

246
00:15:08,254 --> 00:15:10,814
What flowers do you think you'll plant?

247
00:15:11,174 --> 00:15:12,474
Yuri, lilies.

248
00:15:13,214 --> 00:15:13,774
Lilies?

249
00:15:14,434 --> 00:15:16,274
They were my mom's favorite.

250
00:15:16,274 --> 00:15:24,754
Wow, they're growing so fast!

251
00:15:25,454 --> 00:15:26,094
It's funny.

252
00:15:26,354 --> 00:15:27,714
I've never seen them like this.

253
00:15:28,014 --> 00:15:30,834
I always thought lily bulbs were just something you put in egg custards.

254
00:15:31,954 --> 00:15:32,974
Silly, Sumika.

255
00:15:34,734 --> 00:15:36,594
I sure hope they bloom soon.

256
00:15:42,734 --> 00:15:43,994
Not long now.

257
00:15:43,994 --> 00:15:44,494
Yeah.

258
00:15:45,334 --> 00:15:47,194
Did you know your love is about to bloom?

259
00:15:48,154 --> 00:15:49,474
My love is about to bloom?

260
00:15:51,054 --> 00:15:51,534
Yes.

261
00:15:52,414 --> 00:15:53,194
Your love.

262
00:15:54,314 --> 00:15:54,794
Yes.

263
00:15:55,254 --> 00:15:55,954
My love.

264
00:16:09,774 --> 00:16:10,814
Nasty girl!

265
00:16:10,814 --> 00:16:13,994
